# monorepo dev junk must not ship; root node_modules holds the bundled @porcupineai internals
Porcupine/node_modules/
Porcupine/packages/*/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local/private agent state and working artifacts must never enter the npm tarball
.pi/
Project/
research/
bug-reports/
tui-plan.md
docs/plans/
.env
**/.env
*.log
*.cpuprofile
.DS_Store
